# ==========================================================================
# NQ-Docking Suite — .gitignore (consolidado pela auditoria 2026-06-21)
# Repo PRIVADO enquanto o paper SUB01 (ACS Infectious Diseases) estiver em
# desenvolvimento. Nunca versionar segredos, dados pesados nem o manuscrito.
# ==========================================================================

# --- Ambientes / caches ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.idea/
.vscode/
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.before_*
*.partial_*
*.INVALID.txt
*_v3_elemfix.xml

# --- Ambientes virtuais / conda / terceiros ---
PyMol/
venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/
*.egg-info/

# --- Binarios de terceiros / pesados ---
vina.exe
*.exe
*.dll
icone.ico
icone.png

# --- Trajetorias / saidas de MD (GB) ---
*.dcd
*.xtc
*.trr
*.chk
*.checkpoint
*.h5
docking_project/figures/md_clean/*.pdb
docking_project/figures/md_clean/minimized_*.pdb
docking_project/figures/smoke_test_*/

# --- Saidas de runner.execute() real (dry_run=False) -- recriado a cada
# rodada de test_engines.py::test_real_docking_reproduces_golden_grid_center
# (T-0021 Fase A) e de validacoes ad-hoc por campanha; nunca dado do projeto.
docking_project/runs/
docking_project/*/runs/
docking_project/proteins/*_receptor.pdbqt
docking_project/validation/
docking_project/_obsoletos_pdb_errados/

# --- Saidas do HADDOCK (manter inputs/protocolo) ---
haddock3/run-*/
haddock3/*.tgz

# --- Logs / PIDs / estado de execucao ---
*.log
*.pid
*.runlog
*_boot.log
*.boot.out.log
*.boot.err.log
chain_log.txt

# --- Segredos / config local (NUNCA versionar) ---
docking_project/notion_config.json
.env
*.env
venv_info.json
.claude_analysis.json

# --- Manuscrito / scripts-do-paper / artefatos nao-plataforma ---
PAPER/
OBSOLETOS/
paper_tools/
n3_resultados.json
RELATORIO_n3.md

# --- Lixo de serializacao JS ([object Object]) ---
**/_object_Object_/

# --- Bundle estatico publicavel (gerado por export_web.py; vai para o Hostinger) ---
dist_web/
docking_hostinger/
docking_hostinger*.zip

# --- Config local do Claude Code (launch.json com caminhos absolutos, worktrees) ---
.claude/
